Next, build the copy (index.html). Requirements:
1. A single self-contained index.html, all CSS/JS inlined.
2. No backend, no data transmission; no email step; no redirect to a results page; scores shown within the same app.
3. No external requests (no CDN, no WebFonts), works from file://.
