Design plan:
- Page: app shell, gradient background, card in the center.
- Header inside the test card: title "Тестирование DISC (DISC test)", sub "Помните - чем честнее вы с тестом, тем точнее результаты! (Remember — the more honestly you take the test, the more precise the result will be!)", lead "Разместите блоки в порядке от наиболее похожего на вас до наименее похожего (Place the blocks in order of most to least resembling you)".
- Tabs 1..8: "Первый (First)", "Второй (Second)", "Третий (Third)", "Четвертый (Fourth)", "Пятый (Fifth)", "Шестой (Sixth)", "Седьмой (Seventh)", "Восьмой (Eighth)".
- Progress bar under the header (original: (step+1)/8).
- Steps: 3 cards per step. Card title "Я наиболее (I most)" at the top, 4 draggable rows, footer "Я наименее (I least)".
- Buttons: Назад (Back, disabled on step 0), Далее (Next, hidden on the last step), Завершить тест (Finish test, only on the last step).
- Result view: replaces the wizard body (or an overlay) — "Ваш DISC-профиль: (Your DISC profile:)" + "D:x, I:y, S:z, C:w" + a restart button ("Пройти ещё раз (Take it again)" — extra, but the original had no restart... the original result page was a separate page with a link copy. For the copy, adding "Пройти заново (Start over)" is a reasonable convenience but adds behavior not in the original. Hmm — "поведение интерфейса — как в оригинале (interface behavior — as in the original)". The original result screen had a copy-link and a disclaimer. The copy has neither backend nor link. I'll display the "Ваш DISC-профиль" title, the score in the exact format, and a disclaimer note adapted to "индивидуальная расшифровка не даётся (individual decoding not provided)"... no wait, the actual note says: "мы не даём расшифровку ваших индивидуальных результатов. Вместо этого мы помогаем вам научиться использовать этот инструмент для самотестирования, а также для дальнейшей работы с вашими командами, сотрудниками и коллегами. (we do not provide a decoding of your individual results. Instead we help you learn to use this tool for self-testing, as well as for further work with your teams, employees, and colleagues.)" This is an original-site marketing note pointing to their services. For a standalone copy, it's not appropriate to include promotional text referring to the school. Keep the result simple: "Ваш DISC-профиль:" + score in the same format "D:x, I:y, S:z, C:w". Maybe add a short neutral note "Баллы показываются без расшифровки — как в оригинале. (Scores are shown without decoding — as in the original.)"? That's meta noise. Better to keep it clean: title + score. And a "Начать заново (Start over)" button for usability (harmless; helps with the "user repeatedly takes the test" behavior; doesn't exist in the original, but this is a standalone app where the user needs to be able to retake. The original allowed retaking by reopening the modal. So a restart button in the copy corresponds to "reopen" — faithful behavior).

Actually wait — in the original, after finishing, the wizard is closed and the apruve (email) modal opens; after the form success → redirect to the result page → displays score + link copy + disclaimer. The copy requirement: "Шаг сбора email и переход на отдельную страницу результата из оригинала убрать: после завершения теста баллы показываются в том же приложении. (Remove the original's email collection step and transition to a separate results page: after finishing the test, the scores are shown in the same application.)" So: after "Завершить тест", scores appear within the same app. I'll implement a result panel that replaces the test content (keeping the same card), with a "Пройти заново" button.

Drag & drop implementation: custom pointer-based sorting (works on desktop mouse + touch). Details:
