Actually, once item.style.position='fixed', subsequent getBoundingClientRect on other items is stable (fixed doesn't affect layout).

On end: item.classList.remove('dragging'); clear inline styles (position/left/top/width) → it returns to its DOM position. Since its DOM position was updated during the drag, the final rest position = the current DOM order.

